Author: Lexington's examples

.PAGE ONE (three panels)

Panel 1. Wide shot. An office kitchen at night, lit only by the fridge. On the counter, a biscuit tin.

CAPTION
11:47 PM.

Panel 2. Close on the tin. A hand in a black glove lifts the lid.

SFX
Tink.

Panel 3. ANNA (30s, pyjamas, torch) in the doorway, torch beam on the thief.

ANNA
GOTCHA!

ANNA (small)
...Bram?

